## Consulting

We help teams get real work out of coding agents. The work is usually one of three engagements: an audit that finds where the agent loses time and tokens, a setup that installs the rules, skills, tools and verification loop in your repo, or a small tool that fills the gap in your stack. We also do fractional CTO and interim head of engineering work.

Agents are the specialization, not the limit. Between us we ship Go, Kotlin, TypeScript and SQL in production, run our machines on OpenTofu, Kubernetes and Nix, and have built data platforms, mobile apps and web products. Two of our products are data tools (FakeData Pro, DB Diff Pro) and an operations one (Kube Shield, a Kubernetes scanner) is next.

Our proof is our own work: we read ten open-source coding agents at the source, we built a coding agent in five versions, and we publish the measurements from our own repository, CI and model bill.
